ent-MobSpecial = Special
    .desc = A black, four-eyed creature with long, dexterous arms and a segmented tail arched over its back.
ent-MobSpecialGhostRole = Special
    .desc = { ent-MobSpecial.desc }
    .suffix = Ghost role, 250 hours
ent-ActionSpecialStance = Change stance
    .desc = Stand upright to use both hands, or drop your held items and run on all fours. Switching interrupts ongoing tasks and piloting.
ent-ActionSpecialToggleInternals = Toggle internals
    .desc = Breathe from a gas tank worn on your back or belt. Like anyone else, you need a breath mask. Works on all fours too.
ent-ActionSpecialCurl = Curl up
    .desc = Coil your tail around yourself and rest to double regeneration. Movement, attacks and interactions are unavailable. Use again to return to your previous stance.
ent-ActionSpecialNightVision = Night vision
    .desc = Toggle your natural night vision.
ent-ActionSpecialThermalVision = Thermal vision
    .desc = Toggle your natural thermal vision.
ent-SpecialSurviveObjective = Survive until the end of the cycle
    .desc = Survive until the end of the cycle at any cost.
objective-issuer-special = [color=#83c8c7]Survival instinct[/color]
ghost-role-special-name = Special
ghost-role-special-description = You are a Special stranded aboard a wreck. Your only task is to survive until the end of the cycle at any cost.
ghost-role-special-rules = You are a [color=yellow]neutral survivor[/color]. Your only task is to survive until the end of the cycle at any cost. Follow the general conflict rules and do not attack others without a reason.
    You speak and understand only Anti-Traeka. Do not act as if you understand other languages.
    Any gas is breathable at a total pressure strictly above 20 kPa. Suffocation in vacuum takes about eight minutes from full health. Regeneration cannot replace breathing.
    Running on all fours is faster but disables your hands. Switching drops held items, cancels tasks and stops piloting. Stand upright to use hands, bags and ships.
    Curling up doubles regeneration. You continue regenerating in critical condition, but not after death.
language-AntiTraeka-name = Anti-Traeka
chat-language-AntiTraeka-name = Anti-Traeka
language-AntiTraeka-description = Low, resonant trills, clicks and hisses shared by the Specials.
